#. module: l10n_it_financial_statement_eu
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_it_financial_statement_eu/wizard/financial_statement_eu_mapping_wizard.py:0
msgid "The file has no sheet with the accounts."
msgstr "Il file non ha un foglio con i conti."

#. module: l10n_it_financial_statement_eu
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_it_financial_statement_eu/wizard/financial_statement_eu_mapping_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The file has three sheets. \"Lines\" lists the lines of the financial "
"statements (art. 2424-2425 c.c.): only the lines with \"yes\" in the "
"\"Assignable\" column can receive accounts, the others are totals or are "
"computed. \"Accounts\" lists the accounts of the chart of accounts, with "
"their movements from %(date_from)s to %(date_to)s and their current lines. "
"Fill in the \"%(debit_line)s\" and \"%(credit_line)s\" columns of "
"\"Accounts\" with the codes of the lines, then import the file with the same"
" wizard: the changes are shown before they are applied."
msgstr ""
"Il file ha tre fogli. \"Voci\" elenca le voci del bilancio (artt. 2424-2425 "
"c.c.): solo le voci con \"sì\" nella colonna \"Assegnabile\" possono "
"ricevere conti, le altre sono totali o voci calcolate. \"Conti\" elenca i "
"conti del piano dei conti, con i movimenti dal %(date_from)s al %(date_to)s "
"e le voci attuali. Compilare le colonne \"%(debit_line)s\" e "
"\"%(credit_line)s\" di \"Conti\" con i codici delle voci, poi importare il "
"file con la stessa procedura guidata: le modifiche vengono mostrate prima di"
" essere applicate."

#. module: l10n_it_financial_statement_eu
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_it_financial_statement_eu/wizard/financial_statement_eu_mapping_wizard.py:0
msgid "The file is neither an XLSX nor a CSV file."
msgstr "Il file non è né un XLSX né un CSV."

#. module: l10n_it_financial_statement_eu
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_it_financial_statement_eu/wizard/financial_statement_eu_mapping_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The file to return is the same file, as XLSX, or a CSV file with the columns"
" \"%(code)s\", \"%(debit_line)s\", \"%(credit_line)s\" and, if useful, "
"\"%(notes)s\". Whoever fills it in, a person or an AI assistant, returns all"
" the accounts and uses only the codes of the \"Lines\" sheet with \"yes\" in"
" \"Assignable\"."
msgstr ""
"Il file da restituire è lo stesso file, in formato XLSX, oppure un file CSV "
"con le colonne \"%(code)s\", \"%(debit_line)s\", \"%(credit_line)s\" e, se "
"utile, \"%(notes)s\". Chi lo compila, una persona o un assistente AI, "
"restituisce tutti i conti e usa solo i codici del foglio \"Voci\" con \"sì\""
" in \"Assegnabile\"."

